    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορμ-ίον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορμός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small log,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).233.13
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stud.Pal.</u>
				10.259.11
			</span></i> (V <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>trunk</i> or <i>body</i> of an undershirt, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in Rh.</u>
				106.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορμίν, τό</span>, <i>barrel</i> of a horse, interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				115
			</span></i>.</div>
